  "privacyIntroText": "This page explains how the Sallehly platform collects, uses, and protects your data.",
  "dataWeCollectSectionTitle": "Data We Collect and Why",
  "dataStorageSectionTitle": "Where Your Data Is Stored and How It's Protected",
  "dataStorageSectionBody": "Your data is stored on our servers, and every connection between the app and the server is encrypted via HTTPS. Your password is stored in encrypted (hashed) form that no one, including our team, can recover. Chat messages are stored in our database so they can be shown to you and the other party in the conversation, and are reviewed by our admin team only when a complaint or violation requires it.",
  "thirdPartySharingSectionTitle": "Sharing Data with Third Parties",
  "thirdPartySharingSectionBody": "We don't sell your data or share it with any advertiser. The only exception is Firebase Cloud Messaging (a Google service), which we use exclusively to send notifications to your device — this requires sharing only your device's notification identifier, and no other data.",
